ComicCraft – AI Comic Story Creator Using Gemini Models

Project Demonstration

1. Project Introduction

ComicCraft is an AI-based comic story creation application that uses Google Gemini models to transform a simple user idea into a complete comic story.

The application helps users generate stories, characters, dialogues, scenes, and comic panels using AI.


---

2. Demonstration Flow

Step 1 – Open the Application

Launch the ComicCraft web application.

The home page displays the project name and comic creation options.


Step 2 – Enter Story Idea

The user enters a simple prompt.


Example:

> “Create a superhero story about a college student who discovers the power to control electricity.”



The user can select the genre, number of panels, and story style.


Step 3 – Generate Story

Click the Generate Comic button.

The application sends the prompt to the Gemini model.

Gemini processes the request and generates the story.


Step 4 – AI Generates Characters The system generates details such as:

Character name

Appearance

Personality

Role in the story

Special abilities


Step 5 – Generate Comic Panels The generated story is divided into multiple panels.

For example:

Panel	Content

1	Introduction of the main character
2	Character discovers a mysterious power
3	Character learns to control the power
4	Villain appears
5	Hero fights the villain
6	Hero saves the city


Each panel contains scene description, character actions, dialogue, and narration.

Step 6 – Edit the Comic

User can modify the generated story.

Dialogues and scenes can be edited.

Individual panels can be regenerated if required.


Step 7 – Preview

Click Preview Comic.

The complete comic is displayed panel by panel.

User can check the story flow and dialogues.


Step 8 – Save and Export

The completed comic can be saved as a project.

The user can export the comic in a supported format such as PDF or images.



