5. Sample Demonstration

User Prompt:

> “Create a 4-panel comedy comic about a student who is always late to college.”



Gemini Output:

Panel 1:
The student wakes up late and looks at the clock in shock.

Dialogue:
“WHAT?! 9:30 already?!”

Panel 2:
He rushes outside without having breakfast.

Dialogue:
“College first, breakfast later!”

Panel 3:
He reaches college and discovers that it is Sunday.

Dialogue:
“Wait… TODAY IS SUNDAY?!”

Panel 4:
He sits down sadly while his friends laugh.

Caption:
“Sometimes, being late isn't the problem. Being early on the wrong day is.”


---

6. Conclusion

The demonstration shows how ComicCraft uses Gemini AI to convert a simple idea into a structured comic story. It reduces the effort required for writing and planning comics and provides users with an easy way to create, edit, preview, and export AI-generated comics.
